{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:08:49Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:38:49+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:38:53+05:30\nThe search for \"Apple Mac Mini M6 32GB upgrade price India ₹ Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB 64GB upgrade cost rupees CTO\" returned the following summary:\nThe Apple Mac Mini models featuring the **M6** and **M5 Pro** chips were released in India on September 22, 2026.\n\nBecause Apple Silicon uses unified memory architecture, **memory is integrated into the chip and cannot be upgraded after purchase.** You must select your desired memory configuration (RAM) at the time of ordering (Configure-to-Order or CTO).\n\n### Mac Mini Pricing in India\nThe starting prices for the current lineup are as follows:\n\n| Model | Starting Price (Base Model) |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Mac Mini (M6)** | ₹99,900 |\n| **Mac Mini (M5 Pro)** | ₹2,09,900 |\n\n### Upgrade Information (CTO)\n*   **M6 Model:** The base model typically starts with 16GB of unified memory and can be configured up to **32GB** at the time of purchase.\n*   **M5 Pro Model:** The M5 Pro configurations support higher memory capacities, with options up to **64GB** of unified memory.\n\n**How to get exact pricing for your configuration:**\nTo find the specific cost difference for upgrading the memory (e.g., from 16GB to 32GB or 64GB), please visit the official [Apple India Store online](https://www.apple.com/in/store). \n\n1.  Select the **Mac Mini** model you are interested in.\n2.  Click on the **\"Buy\"** button.\n3.  Choose your chip (M6 or M5 Pro).\n4.  In the configuration menu, you will see the available memory options. Selecting a higher memory tier will automatically update the price, showing you the exact cost in Rupees for that specific configuration.\n\n**Note:** Apple frequently offers education pricing (e.g., ₹88,900 starting price for the M6 model) and seasonal cashback offers (typically up to ₹15,000 on selected models with eligible cards), which may apply to your purchase."}
