{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:09:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:39:01+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:39:07+05:30\nThe search for \"Apple Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB 512GB price Mac Mini M6 32GB 512GB price USD configuration\" returned the following summary:\nAs of October 2026, the updated Mac mini is available with the **M6** chip or the **M5 Pro** chip[1][2]. Pricing and configuration details for the models you requested are provided below.\n\n### **Pricing and Configuration (USD)**\n\nBecause Apple uses a \"configure-to-order\" model, prices for specific memory (RAM) and storage upgrades are added to the base price of the respective chip models[3][4].\n\n*   **Mac mini with M6 Chip**\n    *   **Base Price:** Starts at **$899**[5][1][2].\n    *   **Configuration (32GB / 512GB):** Upgrading from the base 16GB memory to 32GB typically adds $400 to the price[3]. With the base 512GB storage included, a configured M6 Mac mini with 32GB RAM and 512GB SSD is approximately **$1,500**[3].\n\n*   **Mac mini with M5 Pro Chip**\n    *   **Base Price:** Starts at **$1,699**[5][1].\n    *   **Configuration (48GB / 512GB):** The M5 Pro models support higher memory tiers[3][5]. Based on Apple’s upgrade pricing (where 48GB memory is a $600 upgrade over the base)[3], a configuration with 48GB of memory and 512GB of storage generally prices out around **$2,300**. (Note: Retailers like B&H have occasionally listed specific configurations like the 15-core M5 Pro with 24GB RAM at discounted prices around $1,669)[6].\n\n### **Summary of Differences**\n| Feature | Mac mini (M6) | Mac mini (M5 Pro) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Target Use** | Everyday tasks, AI agents, home server[3][7] | Demanding creative work, video/game dev[1][8] |\n| **Max Memory** | Up to 32GB[8] | Up to 64GB[7][8] |\n| **Starting Price** | $899[1][2] | $1,699[1] |\n\n*Disclaimer: Prices can fluctuate based on ongoing promotions, regional taxes, and specific retailer discounts[6][8]. It is recommended to check the official Apple Store online for the most accurate current configuration pricing.*\n\nSources:\n[1] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFToGQKZwYyNTYzLcC5CeqgYnXnHPbz2_g20Dyr6W8M5rSoV07Z44VlkbmzEri9iF6yzInb2nz_AyJqaP4RC9Qt6X0VidyqONUZ3ti_qLb0LtSmNspxOS4yvl9E1rkVYNpOMXMG1HPJ-UER4BYyL9V7fnwnA5EtRh_EayGokETjfijj72iUE2MGX8552g7nA0ae)\n[2] [pocketmags.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7KT54ftB7-Fzlx3NynbBteW_dsND4E85Vq7wur6R5QTyT7Rql9Re2uMpLJPvucEBmPxtp81CWZTvgIIRZwQQ4HUurYQoe-vTf9jiAyuCqKHo5z8QoTknm90rSZ_PX9jf-Ld3XkahXoWL3AzKCBSu466hBf4YloJYt2QxwuA==)\n[3] [adamtalks.tech](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF56ekRoJFNkbZKjnx7f3IjcNWZ07qOaeQdRFqt8nWm-zWKg8N-LPfMhzt9qpIEVUbdwpYXZN0MRhkEKqeTVRG7CYJEWNN-Z73JVyaAw67wrG6AD_OhdQYAK3cft5Y2_FvXsl_vC7tUlyGk2_bjB-p8xzVy3MX7ZOc6CpE=)\n[4] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFToGQKZwYyNTYzLcC5CeqgYnXnHPbz2_g20Dyr6W8M5rSoV07Z44VlkbmzEri9iF6yzInb2nz_AyJqaP4RC9Qt6X0VidyqONUZ3ti_qLb0LtSmNspxOS4yvl9E1rkVYNpOMXMG1HPJ-UER4BYyL9V7fnwnA5EtRh_EayGokETjfijj72iUE2MGX8552g7nA0ae)\n[5] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHEGhtZOSdV58PyfMuiIO1zD_YKnTtElYl2vBqiD_IHesV01UAGhdpdo8CifcgrMNPfrtMXgcjKkPXvEK3xEJ7SkT3nVRHmLCyPDGZIF54fLgOouTx1gv-uf9afFo8HpPoj)\n[6] [bhphotovideo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHHkS9kTHKkcbON4uVm4VR0p6pD_G9Z1D5T8r9kuHi6OT_igqPLYsIe5M67aGhTw8vUqoPbCs_b4PilFrx87hlEVptDe6O_tIXDeTQCcVkuNhLB0HOTIRz40Zp_aozgjjMUSn4FidqxWeXohNRFp2ooEHNxFrwn07XfORhKEl-Gst5WFslRHwlgcZN4ho8=)\n[7] [cnet.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGhSt7XoYnUfQBsoLeo-sY3Dm0W10tCdgn-BwbAREZ28sKf04tpa5DbONy_2WtF8QS3z_yPG2gV9d3EGtiMUWe2FTy8UKHy1X0YEXWJuJQTuKTljyB1Fu98zsPIm9Qrl2LFmAs05yAt0ra6tYVv0J8XSkTqyJ0C